        <div class="faq__a">Yes. Financing options are available, and we will walk you through them during the consultation so you know what the project looks like month to month before you commit to anything.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What does the warranty cover?</summary>
        <div class="faq__a">Every project carries a <b>five-year warranty on our labor</b>. Materials and appliances keep their own manufacturer warranties, which we hand over to you at the final walk-through.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Who pulls the permits?</summary>
        <div class="faq__a">We do. Drawings, permit applications and inspections in Fairfax County, Arlington County and Montgomery County, MD are handled by us as part of the project.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you design, or do I need my own designer?</summary>
        <div class="faq__a">We are design and build under one roof. You can bring your own drawings if you have them, but most clients start with us from a blank room &mdash; we design the layout around how you actually use the space, then build it with our own crew.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which areas do you serve?</summary>
        <div class="faq__a">Tysons, McLean, Arlington, Alexandria and Great Falls in Virginia, plus Bethesda and Potomac in Maryland. If you are just outside that, call and ask &mdash; we will give you a straight yes or no.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

